    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Meet Captions: local Mandarin↔English live captions for calls on macOS

Native Swift menu-bar app (ScreenCaptureKit system-audio capture, optional mic,
floating caption panel with speaker colors) and a Python server running
Silero VAD → Qwen3-ASR-1.7B → CAM++ speaker embeddings → Hy-MT2-1.8B via Ollama,
streaming translations word by word. Models chosen by benchmark (server/bench);
tests, setup/build scripts, README and CLAUDE.md included.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
